# Binary artifacts. Git's text/binary guess looks for a NUL in the first 8 KB, and a
# ReportLab PDF has none there - so without this, core.autocrlf rewrote their line
# endings, broke the xref offsets, and a fresh checkout needed repairing to open.
*.pdf   binary
*.pptx  binary
*.png   binary
*.pt    binary
*.pth   binary
*.npz   binary
*.map   binary
